Attribution
-----------
The tabular Q-learning allocation policy used to produce the published results
of this work was implemented by a colleague at Nearby Computing and is NOT
included in this repository. The system design -- state and action encoding,
reward shaping, the reconfiguration trigger, and the policy interface -- was
developed jointly. See agents/README.md.

The closed-loop controller, the 5G core integration, the Prometheus exporter,
the Grafana dashboard provisioning, the container images, the Helm charts and
the deployment tooling in this repository are the author's own work.

This project integrated with a separate commercial orchestration platform in
its original deployment. That layer is proprietary and out of scope here.
